# BMAD Delete Configuration
# Lists all folders and files to remove when uninstalling BMAD from a project.
#
# Format:
#   - Lines starting with # are comments
#   - Blank lines are ignored
#   - Trailing slash (/) indicates a directory (optional, both work)
#   - Glob patterns (* and ?) are supported
#   - Paths are relative to the target project root

# ── Core BMAD directories (fully owned by BMAD) ──────────────────────────────
_bmad/

# ── Shared directories: only BMAD-managed subdirectories ─────────────────────
.agents/skills/bmad-*
.claude/skills/bmad-*
.github/agents/bmad-*

# ── User BMAD directories (may contain user content, delete with caution) ────
#_bmad-custom/
#_bmad-docs/
#_bmad-output/
#_bmad-shared/

# ── BMAD scripts copied to the destination project ───────────────────────────
#scripts/clean-bmad-config.sh
#scripts/lib/bmad-patterns.sh
#scripts/lib/colors.sh
